# Fresh-process run-0 benchmark for legacy JKR lookup construction.
atom_style granular
boundary f f f
newton off
communicate single vel yes
units si
region box block 0 0.02 0 0.01 0 0.01 units box
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 single 0.005 0.005 0.005 units box
set atom 1 diameter 0.0028
set atom 1 density 1500
fix young all property/global youngsModulus peratomtype 5e6
fix poisson all property/global poissonsRatio peratomtype 0.3
fix restitution all property/global coefficientRestitution peratomtypepair 1 0.5
fix friction all property/global coefficientFriction peratomtypepair 1 0.8
fix adhesion all property/global workOfAdhesion peratomtypepair 1 0.3
fix resolution all property/global resolutionJKR scalar 1e-4
pair_style gran model jkr tangential history
pair_coeff * *
neigh_modify delay 0
run 0
